# clamber-scenario v1
#
# The README's gameplay capture (tools/capture.sh): from the title
# screen, the opening of the first level, then pause. The inputs are the
# first 1000 frames of tests/playthrough/first-level.scn, 41 frames later
# because the level starts on the frame after Start is picked.
id: first-tour
summary: The opening of the first level, for the README's GIF
requires: content/base/levels/first.level
start: the title screen, before the level starts
frames: 1071

